","ts":"1616601996.021600","thread_ts":"1616556440.016000","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bRUGB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b804633-e524-474a-924f-894a8eb13540","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"じゃあちょっと勧誘してみますね","ts":"1616602511.021800","thread_ts":"1616556440.016000","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ck2B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00b2c5e8-8e0b-4e1b-9e65-b5033d45e84b","type":"message","user":"UK0JC4CM8","text":"29日がリア友休み確定してるので、29日は6人集まれるなら行けます","ts":"1616602743.022000","thread_ts":"1616556440.016000","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f/1GA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26ccf7cb-5f5b-4262-8880-46b4a0b88197","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"1. どちらに行きたいか (潜水艦 or 人魚姫 or どちらでもよい)\n2. 潜水艦の場合、都合のよい日、あるいは悪い日はいつか\n\nを皆さん教えてくださいー\nTODO: 明日メンションする","ts":"1616602987.022200","thread_ts":"1616556440.016000","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VbwsV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5471800-f50d-4a7f-8e7f-92f67106789e","type":"message","user":"U01SP8D5QE5","text":"はじめまして！YMDに誘われてホイホイされましたれいじと申します！！4/29いけます！！もうなんもわからなくなると途端に素数数え出すやつですがきっと楽しいと思うので参加させてください～～。","ts":"1616603527.023800","thread_ts":"1616556440.016000","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"abJF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e065b42-d5ec-430e-8a5c-d55ad0ac34f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"よろしくお願いします！素数を数えるスキル！","ts":"1616603585.024000","thread_ts":"1616556440.016000","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":